{"header":{"type":"esummary","version":"0.3"},"result":{"uids":["200030622"],"200030622":{"uid":"200030622","accession":"GSE30622","gds":"","title":"Dual Role of FoxA1 in Androgen Receptor Binding to Chromatin, Androgen Signaling and Prostate Cancer [Expression Array]","summary":"We report the dual role of FoxA1 in androgen receptor recruitment to the chromatin of androgen responsive prostate cancer cell line LNCaP-1F5 using ChIP-sequencing. Depletion of FoxA1 reprograms both androgen and glucocorticoid receptor recruitment and subsequent gene expression. The ChIP-seq has been performed using AR, FoxA1, GR, H3K4me2 antibodies. We have also mapped the DNaseI-hypersensitive sites (DHS) using deep sequencing.","gpl":"6947;10558","gse":"30622","taxon":"Homo sapiens","entrytype":"GSE","gdstype":"Expression profiling by array","ptechtype":"","valtype":"","ssinfo":"","subsetinfo":"","pdat":"2011/09/14","suppfile":"TXT","samples":[{"accession":"GSM759649","title":"Vehicle parental rep1_v4"},{"accession":"GSM759646","title":"Vehicle siFoxA1 rep2_v3"},{"accession":"GSM759655","title":"DEX siFoxA1 rep1_v4"},{"accession":"GSM759651","title":"DEX parental rep1_v4"},{"accession":"GSM759652","title":"DEX parental rep 2_v4"},{"accession":"GSM759654","title":"Vehicle siFoxA1 rep2_v4"},{"accession":"GSM759643","title":"DHT parental rep1_v3"},{"accession":"GSM759642","title":"Vehicle parental rep2_v3"},{"accession":"GSM759656","title":"DEX siFoxA1 rep 2_v4"},{"accession":"GSM759648","title":"DHT siFoxA1 rep 2_v3"},{"accession":"GSM759645","title":"Vehicle siFoxA1 rep1_v3"},{"accession":"GSM759641","title":"Vehicle parental rep1_v3"},{"accession":"GSM759644","title":"DHT parental rep 2_v3"},{"accession":"GSM759647","title":"DHT siFoxA1 rep1_v3"},{"accession":"GSM759650","title":"Vehicle parental rep2_v4"},{"accession":"GSM759653","title":"Vehicle siFoxA1 rep1_v4"}],"relations":[],"extrelations":[],"n_samples":16,"seriestitle":"","platformtitle":"","platformtaxa":"","samplestaxa":"","pu